                                                                <i class="im-icon-cog-5 mm_list_marker primary_theme_color-color"></i>
                                                                <p>Applicant has to complete a one-time verificationlregistration at the respective Regional Office of MIDC.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="list-group-item-text">
                                                                <i class="im-icon-cog-5 mm_list_marker primary_theme_color-color"></i>
                                                                <p>Once registered, applicant uploads application online for Provisional Fire Approval (combined) through BPAMS.</p>
                                                            </div>

                                                            <div class="list-group-item-text">
                                                                <i class="im-icon-cog-5 mm_list_marker primary_theme_color-color"></i>
                                                                <p style="text-decoration:underline">Applicant has to upload the below mentioned Fire Service Primary &amp; Additional documents online:</p>
                                                                <div class="list-group nestedlist sublist" style="margin-left: 4%; margin-top: -1%;">
