                                                                            <i class="im-icon-crown mm_list_marker primary_theme_color-color" style=""></i>
                                                                            <p style="font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">Approvals under different Acts such as chief control of explosive for storage of hazards goods, gases and solvents under Petroleum Act and Rules, approvals from Civil Aviation and the authority / defence authority for building height near airport areas (If applicable).</p>
                                                                        </div>

                                                                            <div class="list-group-item-text it1" style="color: black;">
                                                                            <i class="im-icon-crown mm_list_marker primary_theme_color-color" style=""></i>
                                                                            <p style="font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">In case of existing company approved building plan approval accorded by MIDC and copy of Building Completion Certificate.</p>
